= Target Section <target-section>

Plain reference: @target-section.

Named reference: @target-section[the target section].

Explicit reference: #ref(<target-section>, supplement: [custom target]).

Citation: #cite(<target-section>).

Citation with supplement: #cite(<target-section>, supplement: [chapter 2]).

Footnote call: #footnote[Footnote body with #emph[emphasis].]
